methods.description:
The format string follows the 
[IEEE printf specification](http://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/009695399/functions/printf.html).

For each "conversion specification" (ie. `%s` for a string or `%d` for a number) used inside
the string, `formatString` argument, the respective value is substituted from the
argument list. For example:

``` js
var forename = 'Paul';
var number = 21;
var message = String.format('Welcome, %s! You are visitor number %d', forename, number);
Ti.API.info(message);
```
